/target

# Render dumps from the engine's own diagnostics. Regenerated on every
# run and several MB each — a committed BMP stays in the pack forever,
# even after a later delete. The old /sample.* pair grew into a whole
# family (bootstrap, *_sheet, svg_demo, …), so match by extension.
*.bmp
*.png

# Stylesheet dumped from a fetched page while debugging the cascade.
/resolved.css

# Test fixtures under testdata/ ARE source and stay tracked.
!testdata/**
